  "description": "The Hayati Pro Max Plus 6000 Prefilled Pod Kit is a compact, user-friendly device designed for long-lasting performance and simple operation. Each kit includes a prefilled 2ml pod paired with an integrated 10ml refill reservoir, providing a total of 12ml of 20mg Nic Salt e-liquid. This system ensures extended use with no messy refilling or coil changes, making it an ideal choice for everyday convenience. Equipped with dual mesh coil technology, the Pro Max delivers consistent vapour production and reliable flavour clarity from start to finish. The draw-activated design means there are no buttons to press, while the integrated 600mAh rechargeable battery supports extended use between charges. With up to 6000 puffs per pod (approx.), the Pro Max balances portability with lasting performance. The Hayati Pro Max kit is compatible only with Hayati Pro Max Plus Prefilled Pods , available in a range of flavours to suit different tastes. Options include fruit, soda-inspired, and menthol profiles, offering variety without complexity. Simply insert your chosen pod, and the device automatically manages the refill process for a smooth, dependable vape. Hayati Pro Max Plus Kit Flavours • Blueberry Cherry Cranberry A rich blend of Blueberry, Cherry, and tart Cranberry. • Pink Lemonade Sweet and tangy Pink Lemonade with a fizzy twist. • Red Apple Ice Crisp Red Apple with a refreshing icy finish. • Ice Pop Fruity, sweet, and chilled—just like your favourite frozen treat. • Strawberry Raspberry Ice A cool and fruity mix of Strawberry and Raspberry. • Strawberry Raspberry Cherry A juicy trio of ripe red berries for a rich flavour blend. • Blueberry B' Gum Classic Bubblegum sweetness with smooth Blueberry notes. • Pipeline Punch A tropical fusion of fruity energy drink flavours. • Blueberry Pomegranate Sweet Blueberry paired with tart Pomegranate. • Banana Ice Smooth and creamy Banana finished with a brisk icy touch. • Strawberry H' Bubba Sweet Bubblegum with a burst of Strawberry flavour. • Cherry Berry A rich, sweet blend of Cherry and mixed Berries. • Juicy Peach Soft and sweet Peach with a ripe, juicy finish. • Blue Razz Blackcurrant Tangy Blue Raspberry balanced by deep Blackcurrant tones. • Blackberry Raspberry Dark Blackberry paired with bright, tart Raspberry. • Strawberry Kiwi Sweet Strawberry with a touch of tangy Kiwi. • Summer Dream A tropical fruit cocktail bursting with sunshine flavours. • Strawberry Watermelon Refreshing mix of juicy Strawberry and crisp Watermelon. • Double Menthol Extra-strong Menthol for an intense cooling experience. • Fruit Twist A mixed fruit medley with a sweet, zesty balance. • Mr Blue A mystery mix of Berries with a cooling finish. • Lemon and Lime Sharp and zesty blend of Lemon and Lime. • Cherry Cola Classic fizzy Cola with a hint of sweet Cherry. • Caribb Crush A tropical punch inspired by Caribbean fruits. • Blue Razz Lemonade Blue Raspberry paired with fizzy Lemonade sweetness. • Pineapple Ice Juicy Pineapple with a frosty, cooling finish. • Strawberry Cherry Cranberry A balanced mix of Strawberry, Cherry, and Cranberry. • Watermelon Ice Crisp, juicy Watermelon chilled with ice. • Blue Razz Pineapple Tropical Pineapple infused with tangy Blue Raspberry. • H' Bubba Classic, sweet Bubblegum flavour. • Triple Mango Three layers of juicy, ripe Mango flavour. • Cola Lime Refreshing Cola blended with zesty Lime. • Mad Blue A wild mix of Blueberry, Raspberry, and Blackcurrant. • Strawberry Raspberry Blueberry A smooth trio of summer Berries in perfect balance. • Blueberry Raspberry Sweet Blueberry and tangy Raspberry blend. • Blue Razz GB Blue Raspberry meets nostalgic Grape Bubblegum sweetness. • Blue Sour Raspberry Sour Raspberry candy with a bold tangy edge. • Blue Razz Cherry Tangy Blue Raspberry paired with juicy Cherry. • Fizzy Cherry Sweet Cherry with a sparkling soda-style lift. • Fresh Mint Clean, crisp Mint flavour for pure refreshment. Please Note: A USB-C charging cable is not supplied with this device. Shop Hayati Pro Max Plus Refill Pods",
